#: ../../source/docs/modules/tracker.rst:3 cc5e2a1051a9494f84a3f28e22999d48
msgid "Antenna Tracker"
msgstr "天线跟踪器"

#: ../../source/docs/modules/tracker.rst:9 fd9d80e166fd419d8a9ee12403d6bf90
msgid ""
"This is an improved antenna tracker, where the APM is mounted on an antenna "
"tracker (with a GPS module) which in turn is connected to the ground "
"station. Using the positions of the APM on the UAV and the APM on the "
"antenna, this module will send commands to the antenna APM to alter its "
"azimuth/elevation (via servos on the APM) to maintain tracking with the UAV."
msgstr ""
"这是一个改进型天线跟踪器，APM安装在带有GPS模块的天线跟踪器上，并连接至地面站。该模块利用无人机上APM与天线上APM的位置信息，向天线APM发送命令，通过APM上的舵机调整其方位角/仰角，以实现对无人机的持续跟踪。"

#: ../../source/docs/modules/tracker.rst:16 dc3d8f4e71e749deb32d6d01a9f527a6
msgid ""
"Use ``tracker set port <portname.``` and ``tracker set baudrate <n>``` to "
"set the serial port and baudrate of the tracker."
msgstr ""
"使用 ``tracker set port <portname>`` 和 ``tracker set baudrate <n>`` "
"设置跟踪器的串口和波特率。"

#: ../../source/docs/modules/tracker.rst:19 19527d97b3f44e6ca4dcadc37e1d36f3
msgid ""
"Use ``tracker arm`` and ``tracker disarm`` to arm and disarm the servos on "
"the tracker respectively."
msgstr "使用 ``tracker arm`` 和 ``tracker disarm`` 分别锁定和解锁跟踪器上的舵机。"

#: ../../source/docs/modules/tracker.rst:22 0107d0f09c90491bb05ec69c3a80f5e2
msgid ""
"``tracker level`` will perform the level calibration routine and ``tracker "
"calpress`` will calibrate the barometer, so that air pressure corrections "
"can be sent back to the UAV (for a more accurate altitude estimation)."
msgstr ""
"``tracker level`` 将执行水平校准程序，``tracker calpress`` "
"将校准气压计，以便将气压修正值发送回无人机（以获得更精确的高度估算）。"

#: ../../source/docs/modules/tracker.rst:27 2932cf359e174a54a8c3f9167602d484
msgid "``tracker start`` will start the tracking."
msgstr "``tracker start`` 将开始跟踪。"

#: ../../source/docs/modules/tracker.rst:29 68754c9fc5db47a5b0bbf9695a233750
msgid ""
"There are several parameters for the tracker, to specify the serial port "
"that the antenna tracker APM is on. Use ``tracker param "
"[set|show|fetch|help]`` to manage the parameters. There are three parameters"
" - port, baud and debug."
msgstr ""
"跟踪器有若干参数用于指定天线跟踪器APM所在的串口。使用 ``tracker param [set|show|fetch|help]`` "
"管理参数。共有三个参数：port、baud和debug。"
